Fonts: Noto Sans (Regular, Bold, Italic, Bold Italic) is bundled for translated PDFs under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1; the licence text is in erith_app/assets/fonts/OFL.txt.

MLX (Apple, MIT) and mlx-lm run the translation model inside the app; mlx-audio runs the
Qwen3-TTS voice.

Language models and voices are not part of Erith. The app downloads TranslateGemma
(Google, from mlx-community on Hugging Face) on request; it is a Gemma model and is used
under the Gemma Terms of Use (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms) and its Prohibited Use
Policy (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy). The neural voices are
spoken by Qwen3-TTS (Alibaba Cloud, Apache-2.0), downloaded on request as
mlx-community/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base-bf16. The voice clips in erith_app/assets/voices are
synthetic: Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign (Apache-2.0) made them from a written description
(tools/make_voices.py); they are no person's voice. Other models and voices keep the licences of their authors.
